# One-line-per-request .http file for VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP
# Client, or the `httpyac` CLI. Point PORT at your `next dev` port.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. EMAIL — Alrajhi tax invoice (should AUTO_MATCH → tx #4, SAR 1200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/email
Content-Type: application/json

< ./email-alrajhi.json

### 2. EMAIL — Zamil Steel invoice for an unknown vendor (should UNMATCH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/email
Content-Type: application/json

< ./email-zamil-orphan.json

### 3. WHATSAPP — Alfanar Fuel receipt (should NEEDS_REVIEW — tied twins)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

< ./whatsapp-alfanar.json

### 4. WHATSAPP — Marhaba restaurant with tip (should AUTO_MATCH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

< ./whatsapp-marhaba.json

### 5. WHATSAPP — Petromin receipt for Najm driver (should AUTO_MATCH → tx #8)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

< ./whatsapp-petromin.json

### 6. WHATSAPP — blurry / garbage photo (should FAIL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

< ./whatsapp-garbage.json

### 7. IDEMPOTENCY — refire #1 to prove dedupe (returns outcome=DUPLICATE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/email
Content-Type: application/json

< ./email-alrajhi.json

### 8. VALIDATION — malformed payload returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "not_a": "valid payload" }
